# NOTE: soypaq/public/wms/ is Vite build output but is deliberately COMMITTED.
# Frappe Cloud does not run `npm run build`, so compiled assets must ship in the repo.
# CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) verifies they stay in sync with ui/src.

